OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 JUN
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr Pietsch immerses us in
OL,6,     Gthe sound world of Totus Tuus by
OL,7,     Gthe Polish composer Henryk
OL,8,     GGorecki, composed in 1987 in
OL,9,     Ghonour of a visit to Poland by
OL,10,     GPope John Paul II.
OL,11,G1500FMark Radcliffe's Nature Ramblings
OL,12,     GIn the second part of Mark
OL,13,     GRadcliffe's Nature Ramblings, he
OL,14,     Gfeatures music inspired by
OL,15,     Gmountains, including Grieg,
OL,16,     GLiszt, Mussorgsky and Hawkwind.
OL,17,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,18,     GAlyn Shipton presents jazz
OL,19,     Grecords of all styles as
OL,20,     Grequested by you.
