OL,4,G1700FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, the young
OL,7,     GVienna-born pianist, Lukas
OL,8,     GSternath, performs Liszt's
OL,9,     Gvirtuosic Funerailles and
OL,10,     GSchubert's final Piano Sonata.
OL,11,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from Tewkesbury Abbey, with
OL,13,     Gmusic by Durufle, Bob Chilcott,
OL,14,     GFinzi and Widor.
OL,15,G1900FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,17,     GAnniversary Festival, German
OL,18,     Gviolinist Christian Tetzlaff
OL,19,     Gplays the Six Sonatas and
OL,20,     GPartitas for solo violin, also
OL,21,     Gmarking his 60th birthday.
